        "PublicId": "111331888524",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6105f0a4-6169-48f3-9e54-764cf4ec991b).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. We&apos;ve received intel that Kronstadt Industries CEO Robert Knox has bribed several race marshals in the Global Innovation Race. With this information in mind, we&apos;ve come to the conclusion that the marshals will hand certain victory to Knox&apos;s daughter Sierra, who is competing in the race. See to it that the race marshals are taken care of, and the Knox family learns to play by the rules.",
